<title>UK: Williams EGM approves Chubb offer.</title>
<headline>Williams EGM approves Chubb offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams Holdings Plc said on Monday that shareholders had approved its recommended offers for Chubb Security Plc.</p>
<p>The offer, which was posted on February 28 and values each Chubb ordinary share at 441.33 pence and total share capital at 1.3 billion stg, was approved at an Extraordinary General Meeting today.</p>
<p>'We are delighted to have secured the endorsement of Williams shareholders for the acquisition of Chubb,' Sir Nigel Rudd, chairman of Williams, said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4020</p>
